  "2026-08-21T14:49:23.426Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all-status PM corpus for parent shorthand normalization, create parent identifier prefix, and create --parent missing-reference terms. The closest canonical lineage is closed pm-p9hw (unresolved-parent fail-fast policy), but it does not cover identifier-prefix parity; pm-vk7zek supplied the manual hierarchy test that exposed this separate UX contract."
  "2026-08-22T07:18:09.985Z","harness:codex","Organization rationale 2026-08-22: this item is the sole active record that lacked acceptance, risk, confidence, and estimate metadata. It is now fully specified and parented under CLI command surface and agent ergonomics rather than directly under the portfolio root. Existing verifies and discovered_from lineage is preserved; no duplicate or generic edge was added."
  "2026-09-05T17:53:05.198Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: 8457 tests across 617 files pass at exact 100% lines/statements/functions/branches (60094/62503/12956/47351 covered). Full quality:static passes, including unchanged token ceilings, docstrings, graph composition, and record integrity. Typecheck, version policy, ShellCheck, credential scan, zero-vulnerability dependency audit, and enforced Trivy scan pass. Final npm/npx and Bun/bunx packed smoke covers all 13 packages; separate temporary installed SDK/CLI acceptance passes. Required Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero blocking Sentry groups and no failures lacking error codes. PR review and hosted checks are the remaining delivery stage."
  "2026-09-05T18:16:29.201Z","harness:codex","Review documentation follow-through: add explicit purpose and invariant docstrings to private functions touched by this delivery. Mandatory module/public/member documentation gates already pass; the reviewer uses a broader touched-function denominator. No runtime behavior or quality threshold changes."
  "2026-09-05T18:34:23.033Z","harness:codex","PR #1204 round-one dispositions recorded on every original review/comment surface with up/down reactions. Three documentation/test findings fixed; two unsupported findings answered with source and tracker evidence. Regex heading stripping removed after CodeQL alert 38; hosted revalidation remains pending on the next head. Final local proof: 8458 tests in 617 files, exact coverage 60107/60107 lines, 62520/62520 statements, 12957/12957 functions, 47365/47365 branches. All 68 touched named non-test functions have declaration JSDoc. Full static/type/documentation gates, all five PM-linked runs, final npm/npx+Bun/bunx 13-package smoke, separate temporary packed acceptance, dependency audit, and immutable tracked-tree Trivy scan pass. Sourcery substantive review is unavailable under its current quota; Greptile has not responded. These are availability limitations, not approval."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T17:27:28.665Z","harness:codex","The public normalizeItemReference primitive shares dependency normalization with lifecycle parent persistence. Remote locators preserve case; local uppercase and hash shorthand canonicalize before hierarchy validation. Existing plan/CLI/MCP/package adapters delegate to these SDK lifecycle writers, avoiding adapter-specific normalization."
